 },
 "integration": {
  "summary": "Give the rooftop controller and its zone controllers unique MS/TP addresses and add them to the supervisory controller. The BMS can set system occupancy with GUI Occupancy (MV 14) and system mode with GUI System Mode (MV 15), and reads supply-side temperatures, stage status, static pressure and the alarm points.",
